<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | B Tecky" description="Information about cookies and similar technologies used by B Tecky and third-party services.">
<main><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY & LEGAL / B TECKY</p><h1 class="display">Cookie Policy</h1><p>How cookies and similar technologies may be used on this website.</p><small>Last updated: 1 November 2026</small></div></section><article class="container legal-content">
<section><h2>What cookies are</h2><p>Cookies are small files stored by your browser. Similar technologies may store or read information in your browser or device.</p></section>
<section><h2>Cookies and storage used by B Tecky</h2><p>Some tools may use browser storage to remember settings or a public Google Skills profile URL that you entered. This helps avoid re-entering information. You can clear this data using your browser's site-data controls.</p></section>
<section><h2>Advertising cookies</h2><p>B Tecky may show Google AdSense ads. Google and advertising partners may use cookies or similar technologies to deliver ads, measure performance and personalize ads where permitted. You can manage ad personalization in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Embedded media</h2><p>YouTube embeds and other third-party content may use their own cookies or similar technologies when loaded or played. Their use is governed by the provider's policies.</p></section>
<section><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings. Some website features or embedded services may not work as expected if you disable storage or cookies.</p></section>
<section><h2>More information</h2><p>Read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> or contact <a href="mailto:lavishsheth122@gmail.com">lavishsheth122@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
</article></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal-hero{padding:76px 0 48px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f6ff,#fff)}.legal-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.8rem);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:15px 0}.legal-hero p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:700px;color:#667085;line-height:1.7}.legal-hero small{color:#667085}.legal-content{max-width:850px;padding-block:48px 90px}.legal-content section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e9f0}.legal-content h2{font:800 1.35rem var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.03em}.legal-content p{color:#475467;line-height:1.8}.legal-content a{color:#315efb;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}</style>